        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana DSBS4, 4\" x 4\"  Square Corners Solid Brass Hinge with Square Knuckle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNew from Deltana, the 4 x 4 Square Knuckle Solid Brass Hinge has a modern design. Now all the hardware for your home remodel can match perfectly. The 4 inch x 4 inch  Square Corners Solid Brass Hinge with Square Knuckle is available in several contemporary finishes. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-DSBS4-specifications.gif?v=1704354556\" width=\"538\" height=\"238\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana DSBS4 Hinge Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> Modern 4 Inch Brass Hinge with Square Barrel:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Hinge Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Height: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Knuckle: Square</li>\r\n<li>Corners: Square</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 0.126\"</li>\r\n<li>Standard Template Hole Pattern</li>\r\n<li>Hinge Pin: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Wood Screws: #10 x 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Package includes a pair (2) of hinges and mounting hardware.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-DSBS4-specifications.pdf?v=1704262381\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana DSBS4 Hinge Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWe offer different <a href=\"/pages/deltana-finish-colors\">finishes</a> for this hinge, but no matter which finish you choose, the parts will still be <b>High Quality Solid Brass</b>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold in Pairs (2 Hinges)</b>\r\n</p>",
