                "title": "4 x 4 Square Knuckle Solid Brass Hinge",
                "description": "New from Deltana, the 4 x 4 Square Knuckle Solid Brass Hinge has a modern design. Now all the hardware for your home remodel can match perfectly. The 4 inch x 4 inch  Square Corners Solid Brass Hinge with Square Knuckle is available in several contemporary finishes.",
